{"videoId":"uv0lZl7wdHA","title":"With this DIORAMA I won GOLD in the GOLDEN DEMON 2023","author":"Sergio Calvo Miniatures","authorId":"UCs8aFalGsl9zNW3CEI5h3sg","published":1649109600000,"description":"This Videotutorial and Painting Guide: \n👉❤️ PATREON www.patreon.com/sergiocalvominiatures \n👉 ✨ WEB www.sergiocalvominiatures.com \n👉 🎨 ETSY https://www.etsy.com/es/shop/SergioCalvoMinis\n👉⭐ MINIATURE Mangler Squig - Games Workshop\n-------------------------\nCome on, cheer up, give us a hand to keep building our community, click on the link and subscribe 🥰 And don't forget to share the video so more people can enjoy this wonderful hobby!\n👉https://www.youtube.com/c/SergioCalvoMiniatures?sub_confirmation=1👈\n-------------------------\n⭐More videos⭐\n🏆 Rocco - https://youtu.be/xYN-_gMQL0s\n🏆 Avatar - https://youtu.be/fKSSGi0R_0s\n🏆 Madax - https://youtu.be/Ye618KkewUw\n🏆 Typhus - https://youtu.be/fjacbBOyPKY\n🏆 Mephiston - https://youtu.be/qlYGKRWeSSE\n🏆 Vimir - https://youtu.be/jKsfNWjZ_1k\n🏆Icxtaka - https://youtu.be/L4xVlIuwO44\n-------------------------\n🤩 Channel focused on Painting warhammer miniatures, Warhammer 40k, roleplaying miniatures like d&d, Dungeons and Dragons, Age of sigmar, and in the future Super heroes and sci-fi figures like Marvel or Star wars. Not forgetting Space Marines and of course Space Wolves, 75mm miniatures where I create my magic and not forgetting miniature busts! How to paint NMM, OSL, Leathers, skins, terrain, crystal effects and much more. How to paint warhammer in an easy and fast way with my techniques and knowledge, and why not, having fun. Welcome to the capibases. 🤩\n-------------------------\nKeep in touch! \n✨ WEB www.sergiocalvominiatures.com \n🖌️ YOUTUBE www.youtube.com/sergiocalvominiatures \n❤️ PATREON www.patreon.com/sergiocalvominiatures \n⭐ TWITTER https://twitter.com/Sergiocstudio \n🏆 INSTAGRAM https://www.instagram.com/sergiocalvominiatures\n🍪 https://www.twitch.tv/sergiocalvominiatures\n-------------------------\nDISCLAIMER:\nI take no responsibility for any miniatures painted with Dry brushing and washes 😜","viewCount":357933,"lengthSeconds":948,"watchProgress":0.655641,"timeWatched":1686044045366,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"2TjW4JPYrdmXFQA1"}
{"videoId":"MZSCXE4CpCA","title":"Bon Iver & St. Vincent - Roslyn (Lyrics)","author":"Aurora Vibes","authorId":"UC9uC2wDBPPZOcdBQwCM1dcg","published":1593900000000,"description":"Discover on Spotify\nhttps://ffm.to/sadindie\n\nStream & Download\nSpotify - https://spoti.fi/3aYaavK\nApple Music - https://apple.co/2N4xShR\n\nBon Iver\nhttps://spoti.fi/3daCDky\nhttps://instagram.com/boniver\n\nSt. Vincent\nhttps://spoti.fi/37ciXsH\nhttps://instagram.com/st_vincent\n\nAurora Vibes\nhttps://ffm.to/av-spotify\nhttps://ffm.to/av-instagram\nhttps://ffm.to/av-facebook\n\nPhoto by Simon Migaj \nhttps://unsplash.com/photos/vfud4DJqoco\n\nLyrics for \"Rosyln\" by Bon Iver & St. Vincent\n\nUp with your turret\nAren't we just terrified?\nShale, screen your worry from what you won't ever find\n\nDon't let it fool you\nDon't let it fool you down\nDancing around, folds in her gown\n\nSea and the rock below\nCocked to the undertow\n\nBones blood and teeth erode\nThey will be crashing low\n\nWings wouldn't help you\nWings wouldn't help you down\nDown towards the ground, gravity's proud.\n\nYou barely are blinking\nWagging your face around\nWhen'd this just become a mortal home?\n\nWon't, won't, won't, won't\nWon't let you talk me\nWon't let you talk me... down\nWe'll pull it taut, nothing let out \n\n#BonIver #Rosyln #AuroraVibes","viewCount":75058729,"lengthSeconds":309,"watchProgress":0,"timeWatched":1673346766683,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"2VUyDMhQ6iS5WyBq"}
