{"videoId":"MNK908h7Em4","title":"Is prison architect still worth it in 2024? [Game Review]","author":"Game Grader","authorId":"UCIc-6W6uqfj75mdrQHQwGEw","published":1658684475000,"description":"In this video I tell you what you need to know before you buy Prison Architect in 2024. I Review and answer the question on whether or not Prison Architect is good and worth it. Should you buy / play Prison Architect in 2024? It is in my opinion the best building and prison managing game out there, the base game is amazing. It has fantastic visuals, atmosphere and music, with potential for hundreds of hours of gameplay and replayability.\n\nNow there are of course pros and cons to the game. So in this video I give you the facts about Prison Architect so that you may decide for yourself if this game is for you. But I&apos;d highly recommend buying and playing Prison Architect \n\nI hope you enjoy the video, thanks for watching.\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMake sure to check out all my game reviews here:  https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLa_0fy2zhb17CltmJN_g3ApVicKA_RNZe\nWatch my Satisfactory review here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1jos94kyKxA&t=0s\nWatch my Valheim review here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o8DtbiGOgX0&t=0s\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIf you find my content useful, and would like to support the channel, check out the links below!\nTwitch: https://www.twitch.tv/saluter_  Watch me Live!\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/28YZXTr Join our amazing community discord!\nDonate: https://paypal.me/SaluterTV Buy me Pizza :D\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/prisonarchitect\">#prisonarchitect</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/review2023\">#review2023</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/isitworthit\">#isitworthit</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/beforeyoubuy\">#beforeyoubuy</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/review\">#review</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/gamereview\">#gamereview</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/shouldyoubuy\">#shouldyoubuy</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/beforeyoubuy\">#beforeyoubuy</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/isitworthbuying\">#isitworthbuying</a>","viewCount":26465,"lengthSeconds":384,"watchProgress":14.103459,"timeWatched":1714045907240,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"4aVtmiBNrEGh5Nma","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
