{"videoId":"vQuAQxV0Cs4","title":"REAL FIRE?!  Amazing miniature effect burns down castle!","author":"Real Terrain Hobbies","authorId":"UCJ0ihYQ-HOCbDL69LWnDx3w","published":1667862000000,"description":"Many World's Tavern Coffee: The first 100 of your viewers to use code REALTERRAIN10 at checkout will receive 10% off: https://manyworldstavern.com/discount/REALTERRAIN10\nOrder your Real Terrain Hobbies Builder's Kit here in time for the holidays: https://musekits.com/builderskit\n\nGrab your box now before in time for the holidays!  It is literally the present FULL of presents(and I mean full), guaranteed to be an extremely exciting gift to open and discover all that's inside.  Not to mention a great way to keep you and your loved ones busy for for the holidays!\n\nIn this video I use the Real Terrain Hobbies Builder's kit: Fire and Hammer, to go beyond the project included and use the tools and materials to make the lighthouse for our massive ocean scene for the Talmberg Castle.  We're coming up to the water effects but first, we need a lighthouse and a little something extra to further really spicing up the scene...  a FIRE breathing dragon!   This lighting effect is the most realistic fire I've ever seen and it's so much easier to do than you might expect!\n\nCheck out Nat1 Videos!!! https://www.youtube.com/c/Nat1videos\nGo and check out the amazing fantasy music from @Vindsvept, fantasy music https://www.youtube.com/c/Vindsvept\nPhrozen Sonic Mighty 8K printer: https://phrozen3d.com/products/phrozen-sonic-mighty-8k-resin-3d-printer?variant=43781378867387","viewCount":126512,"lengthSeconds":1319,"watchProgress":1230.29208,"timeWatched":1681471683812,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"92OQiEXdblfps9pP"}
