{"videoId":"gBiiV-ktVZk","title":"2023 Stellaris Beginner's Guide | How to get started in Stellaris Tutorial for 2023","author":"MaxTheCatfish","authorId":"UC7FthPbSyZZjYfxmffSa9eA","published":1653170400000,"description":"Stellaris is a 4X Strategy game from Paradox Interactive and the game has been out for over SIX YEARS now. It's gone through countless iterations, changes, updates, and more. But now with the Stellaris: Overlord DLC released for the game, I think it's finally time to give you an updated Stellaris Beginner's Guide to this massive 4X space game!\n\nThis is the first episode in a series of tutorial videos for Stellaris where I'll be explaining how to get started with Stellaris, which empire to play for your first game of Stellaris, which starting technologies to choose in Stellaris, how to expand your empire in Stellaris, and much much more.\n\n---\n\nSUBSCRIBE FOR FREE ► http://bit.ly/2ukjxnZ\n\nTwitch THREE Days a Week! ► https://twitch.tv/maxthecatfish\n\nTwitter Behind the Scenes! ► https://twitter.com/maxthecatfish\n\n---\nChapters\n00:00 Intro\n01:30 Choosing a Starting Empire\n01:55 Getting Started\n05:29 Science Vessels to Explore and Survey\n07:51 Explaining the User Interface\n13:47 Choosing Starting Technologies\n21:01 Building new Ships\n22:37 Commanding Ships from the Galaxy View\n29:45 Outro","viewCount":185518,"lengthSeconds":1844,"watchProgress":1844.035917,"timeWatched":1684084919141,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"Ez1LjKNWNCxcRYAw"}
