{"videoId":"5rlF-qE-vsM","title":"The Practice Trap","author":"Sycra","authorId":"UC5dyu9y0EV0cSvGtbBtHw_w","published":1672873200000,"description":"Hello!  I know it's been a while since my last video...  A lot has happened.  Also, sorry about the poor video quality and stuff, I'm still getting everything sorted out and really it was a matter of either making an imperfect video or not making anything at all...  Also the picture I drew for this is just whatever because I didn't know what to do but felt the video probably needed some art thing in the background.  Alright, enough about that, if you're still reading this, well, I am surprised!  I bet most people will never see whatever I'm writing here.  I probably could just write whatever and maybe 2% of people will see it.  I guess if you got this far, you can write \"I found the secret stallion!\" in the comments and people will be confused about what the heck that is about.  Or you don't have to, lol.  It's just dumb.  I'm dumb.  Alright, hope you're doing well!  \n\n\nCheck out my webcomic, Space Waitress Kei, here: \nhttps://www.webtoons.com/en/challenge/space-waitress-kei/list?title_no=327401\n\nYou can support me on Patreon at: https://www.patreon.com/Sycra \n\nTools I Use:\n\n-Uniball Signo Gel Ink Pens, in various colours for daily drawings:\nhttps://www.amazon.ca/gp/product/B003FXWGWE/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&camp=15121&creative=330641&creativeASIN=B003FXWGWE&linkCode=as2&tag=sycra04-20&linkId=a00858cf4d7518af1febf3812ec5ae03\n\n-Adobe Photoshop CS6 for digital painting\n\n-Coolorus extension in Photoshop to get the Painter-like color wheel.  You can download it here: http://bit.ly/2bGIQFD\n\n-Procreate on iPad Pro 12.9\" with Apple Pencil for sketching digitally.\n\n-Clip Studio Paint for drawing comics: https://www.amazon.ca/gp/product/B01F70HGA4/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&camp=15121&creative=330641&creativeASIN=B01F70HGA4&linkCode=as2&tag=sycra04-20&linkId=bdf81118406e64c2dda867c250324224\n\n-Wacom Cintiq 22HD: https://www.amazon.ca/gp/product/B008HB5K5O/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&camp=15121&creative=330641&creativeASIN=B008HB5K5O&linkCode=as2&tag=sycra04-20&linkId=8cd6eb4458b6c42dcce0884c455f7203\n\n-Open Broadcaster Software to record my videos: https://obsproject.com/\n\n-Audacity to record my audio: http://www.audacityteam.org/\n\n-Adobe Premiere Pro CS5 to render my videos.\n\n-Smudgeguard glove to keep my hand from directly touching the Cintiq: https://www.amazon.ca/gp/product/B0752BYHZL/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&camp=15121&creative=330641&creativeASIN=B0752BYHZL&linkCode=as2&tag=sycra04-20&linkId=84870e91b2ec06a3ad14e50defa7947a\n\nFollow me on: \nTwitter: https://twitter.com/Sycra\ninstagram: https://www.instagram.com/sycra/\nDeviantart: https://www.deviantart.com/sycra\nPixiv: https://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=7826954\nTumblr: http://sycrayasin.tumblr.com/\n\nFor full length feature tutorials on how to paint, how to draw, and more, visit PencilKings at https://sycrayasin--pencilkings.thrivecart.com/pencilkings-monthly-membership/","viewCount":35462,"lengthSeconds":1258,"watchProgress":172.299145,"timeWatched":1673440283603,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"GIBCkR0ZcYAdXooC"}
{"videoId":"eYO1-gGWJyo","title":"Travis - Sing (Official Music Video)","author":"Travis","authorId":"UCfOY7DHgcXBp2drfyFJQvaw","published":1155247200000,"description":"Stream and buy 'The Invisible Band' 20th Anniversary Deluxe Edition now https://found.ee/travis-theinvisibleband\n\nTravis' infamous video for the first single from their third album \"The Invisible Band\" features the band in a food fight! Now in HD. \n\nTravis \"Sing\" Lyrics\n\nBaby, you've been going so crazy \nLately, nothing seems to be going right \nSolo, why do you have to get so low \nYou're so\nYou've been waiting in the sun too long\n\nBut if you sing, sing, sing, sing, sing, sing \nFor the love you bring won't mean a thing \nUnless you sing, sing, sing, sing\n\nColder, crying on your shoulder \nHold her, and tell her everythings gonna be fine \nSurely, you've been going to early \nHurry, 'cause no one's gonna be stopped\n\nNo, now, now, now, now if you sing, sing, sing, sing, sing, sing \nFor the love you bring won't mean a thing \nUnless you sing, sing, sing, sing\n\nBaby, there's something going on today \nBut I say nothing, nothing, nothing \nNothing, nothing, nothing, nothing, nothing, nothing, nothing\n\nSo, now, now, now, now, now if you sing, sing, sing, sing, sing, sing \nFor the love you bring won't mean a thing \nUnless you sing, sing, sing, sing\nAh baby sing, sing, sing, sing, sing, sing\nFor the love you bring won't mean a thing \nUnless you sing, sing, sing, sing\n\n#Travis #Sing #TheInvisibleBand THE INVISIBLE BAND TURNS 20! To celebrate the 20th Anniversary today we announce a very special Deluxe Edition boxset and North American + UK tour dates in April and May 2022! Click here to pre-order and get your tickets! https://found.ee/travis-theinvisibleband","viewCount":35439306,"lengthSeconds":229,"watchProgress":228.252153,"timeWatched":1673345609467,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"GM0eNLL9Sjh1XhKe"}
{"videoId":"WCWd1TPHZOw","title":"STOP messing up your Brushes","author":"Squidmar Miniatures","authorId":"UCDvZTWvHZPTxJ4K1yTD2a1g","published":1609282800000,"description":"👑👑👑 \nWe have made a brand new fantasy Universe with 10 amazing looking miniatures to paint! You can check out the campaign and support the channel - it goes live October 2022 here:\nhttps://www.kickstarter.com/projects/squidmar/champions-of-sona-75mm-resin-miniatures 👑👑👑\n\nA guide on how to make sure your brushes don't break, and if they break - how to save them. But mostly it's about giving your brush the proper care it deserves before it's too late.\n\n🖌️ Pre-Order Squidmar bust and brushes: https://www.squidmar.com/latepledge \n\n\n🏆 Support me on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/squidmarminiatures \n👍 Squidmars website for full list of gear I use: https://www.squidmar.com/gear  \n👕 Order Squidmar Merch: https://teespring.com/stores/squidmarminiatures\n\n🖌️EU/UK hobby store affiliate - Reference code for extra store credit: EMI7383 \nhttps://elementgames.co.uk/paints-hobby-and-scenery/element-essentials/egaps/squidmar-miniatures/squidmar-nmm-gold?d=10425\n\nAmazon Affiliate Links to stuff i use(As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases you do after following this link - at no cost to you):\n\nMasterson Brush Soap:\nUK: https://amzn.to/3ryczEB\nUSA: https://amzn.to/37VYMQJ\nDE: https://amzn.to/3nYMMmX\n\nJo Sonja brush cleaner & restorer:\nUSA: https://amzn.to/3poDfFW\n\nWindsor & Newton brush cleaner & restorer:\nUK: https://amzn.to/2KGacPE\nUSA: https://amzn.to/3aPej6C\nDE: https://amzn.to/3hrdEd0\n\nCanon M50 (the cameras i use)\nUSA: https://amzn.to/2MWGIN9\nUK: https://amzn.to/2PBlkyT\nDE: https://amzn.to/2PA1Nio\nCAN: https://amzn.to/2MTqaoT\n\nAnycubic i3 Mega (the FDM printer i use)\nUSA: https://amzn.to/2FSRDly\nUK: https://amzn.to/2xu0Hsz\nDEUTSCHLAND: https://amzn.to/2JdquvX\nCANADA: https://amzn.to/2YA95CW\n\nHARDER STEENBECK EVOLUTION SILVERLINE (the Airbrush I use)\nUSA https://amzn.to/2ZO6HrI\nUK https://amzn.to/2Ll5LGm\nGERMANY https://amzn.to/2LmurOD\nCANADA  https://amzn.to/2NGv3S2 \n\nPhrozen Sonic Mini (the Resin printer I use):\nWorldwide: https://phrozen3d.com/collections/resin-3d-printer-phrozen/products/phrozen-sonic-mini-resin-3d-printer?aff=43\nUSA Amazon: https://amzn.to/2FuFsyl \n\nPhrozen Sonic Mini 4k\nWorldwide: https://phrozen3d.com/products/sonic-mini-4k-resin-3d-printer-phrozen?aff=43\n\nEmil On \nInstagram http://www.instagram.com/ageofsquidmar\nfacebook  http://www.facebook.com/ageofsquidmar\nTwitter http://www.twitter.com/ageofsquidmar\n\n\nPainting miniatures for your warhammer & d&d games. Age of sigmar and warhammer 40k. Space Marines, Space Wolves, Stormcast Eternals, beastclaw raiders, ogor mawtribes, cities of sigmar, chaos space marines, painting scale models, miniature busts! How to paint NMM. How to paint warhammer, how to paint d&D figures.","viewCount":596868,"lengthSeconds":880,"watchProgress":880.384579,"timeWatched":1681382472356,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"GP6djhv6SSTaK7xj"}
