ronales-du-cerveau-d-une-mouche_170503\n\nPROJET TIGRE INDE \n\nhttps://www.independent.co.uk/asia/india/project-tiger-50-anniversary-extinction-b2312298.html?utm_source=reddit.com\n\nhttps://www.geo.fr/animaux/inde-le-nombre-de-tigres-sauvages-depasse-3-000-214212\n\nRIVIÈRE INDE \n\nhttps://www.goodnewsnetwork.org/total-rejuvenation-of-indias-kuttamperoor-river-by-rural-community-hailed-as-national-example/?utm_source=dlvr.it&utm_medium=twitter\n\nhttps://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/kuttamperoor-river-in-alappuzha-the-story-of-the-resurrection-of-a-river/article65981430.ece\n\nVACCIN CANCER \n\nhttps://www.theguardian.com/society/2023/apr/07/cancer-and-heart-disease-vaccines-ready-by-end-of-the-decade\n\nhttps://www.letemps.ch/sciences/vaccins-contre-cancer-maladies-cardiovasculaires-dici-2030\n\nOCEAN CLEANUP \n\nhttps://nltimes.nl/2023/04/05/video-ocean-cleanup-removes-200000th-kilogram-plastic-pacific-ocean\n\nhttps://www.goodnewsnetwork.org/ocean-cleanup-hits-milestone-of-220-tons-removed-from-pacific-garbage-patch-watch/\n\n\nORNITHORYNQUE \n\nhttps://www.huffingtonpost.fr/environnement/article/australie-un-ornithorynque-et-ses-deux-ravisseurs-recherches-par-la-police_216237.html\n\nhttps://www.lefigaro.fr/voyages/australie-interpelles-pour-avoir-pris-le-train-avec-un-ornithorynque-20230407\n\n\nCOIFFEUR \n\nhttps://www.cbsnews.com/news/vernon-jackson-barber-free-haircuts-children-with-special-needs-opens-noble-barber-beauty-on-day-off-cincinnati/\n\nhttps://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/apr/13/cincinnati-free-haircut-children-special-needs\n\n\n\nÉcriture : Madeleine de Blic - Blanche Vathonne - Paul Bonnaud - Hugo Travers \nMontage : Dorothée Biechy","viewCount":166150,"lengthSeconds":495,"watchProgress":494.886892,"timeWatched":1681749402252,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"GeboRUPxq9dCJiDV"}
