{"videoId":"_zq3V28qp2w","title":"Renpy GUI Customization | Main Menu in Ren'Py","author":"Zeil Learnings","authorId":"UCDTudD6XxgHhmpxiR-hLiOg","published":1625522400000,"description":"This is the first video of my Renpy GUI Customization series. In this video, we'll focus on the main menu which may change the game menu as well. I'll create Ren'py tutorials on other screens as well. \n\n\nUPDATE: It should not be \"if main_menu\" but \"if renpy.get_screen(\"main_menu\"):\"\nThis is to solve the issue of not showing the correct alignment when clicking Load, Options, About or Help from the main_menu.\n\nThank you to Serhii Korinnyi for letting me know of this issue and providing the solution!\n\n\nNote: \n  -  I'm using 1920 x 1080 resolution in the Ren'Py project.\n  -  You must know the Ren'Py basics to understand this video.\n     To learn the basics, you can watch this video:\n     Ren'Py in 8 minutes: https://youtu.be/C3Ldd-5PKCw\n\nDiscord server: https://discord.com/invite/QY3hABSgvM\n\n📚  Chapters\n0:00 Intro\n0:26 Background image\n1:47 button: xalign\n2:28 vbox: xalign and yalign\n3:58 button: idle_color\n4:25 button: hover_color\n4:52 font\n5:48 font: size\n6:26 vbox: spacing\n7:31 Hide game title\n8:12 separating the main_menu from the game_menu\n9:16 game_menu xoffset and yalign\n10:35 button: selected_color\n12:33 renaming a button: preferences\n13:02 outlines\n\n👐 Ren'Py has an active and helpful community.\nQuestions also welcome here:\nRen'Py Forum (Lemma Soft): https://lemmasoft.renai.us/forums/index.php\nRen'Py Discord server: https://t.co/OA75kMlcVX?amp=1\nReddit: https://www.reddit.com/r/RenPy\n\n🌸 My pages:\nitch.io: https://zeillearnings.itch.io/\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/ZeilLearnings\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/ZeilLearnings\nBMC: https://www.buymeacoffee.com/ZeilLearnings","viewCount":60913,"lengthSeconds":855,"watchProgress":76.896925,"timeWatched":1677339252095,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"IeQl2XTKA4al90ez"}
{"videoId":"DKIzn9reZto","title":"Substraction Tricks | #subtraction #subtractiontricks #shorts #short #mathematics #shortvideo","author":"Studies Vid","authorId":"UCipMotRU-_XSTxW73Yl7JWw","published":1670022000000,"description":"Substraction Tricks | #subtraction #subtractiontricks #shorts #short #mathematics #shortvideo\n@Studies_Vid \n\n\n\nMath tricks can help you solve math problems quickly and easily. In this video, I'm going to show you some math tricks that you can use to solve any math problem in your head.\n\nIn this video, I'm going to show you some math tricks that will help you solve problems faster and without using a calculator. You will learn how to calculate the sum of a series of numbers, find the product of two numbers, tell if one number is larger than another, and more!\n\nThis is a video about math tricks. The tricks are easy and fun to do, and you can use them in your everyday life.\n\n\nkeywords\nVedic maths tricks for fast calculation\nvedic maths tricks\nvedic maths trick\nvedic maths multiplication tricks\nvedic maths full course\nvedic maths for kids\nvedic maths\nvedic mathematics\nmaths tricks\nmath tricks by studies vid\nmath is easy\nmathematics\nmath short tricks in hindi\nmaths\ndon't memorise vedic maths\nwhat are some math tricks\nwhat is math tricks\nmath best trick\nhow do math tricks work\nmath tricks calculation fast\nhow does the math tricks work\nhow do you do tricks on a calculator\nhow to math short tricks\nhow amazing math tricks\nwhich math best tricks\npuzzles math\nmathematics tricks\nmath tricks with answer \nmath tricks to solve fast\ntricks mathematics\nmath new tricks\n\n#calculationtricks \n#vedicmathsforfastcalculation \n#vedicmathsbesttrick\n#mathstricks \n#mathsfun \n#maths \n#mathsmasti \n#mathstable\n#youtubeshorts \n#youtubeshort \n#youtube \n#ytshorts \n#ytshort \n#youtuber \n#vedic \n#tiktok","viewCount":1262,"lengthSeconds":17,"watchProgress":10.498192,"timeWatched":1682671316324,"isLive":false,"paid":fa