{"videoId":"sBDVPoNXyVI","title":"HOW TO THIN YOUR PAINTS: A Step-By-Step Guide","author":"Brushstroke Painting Guides","authorId":"UCsnxQDYmE-HnaSD8TEohMNg","published":1678834800000,"description":"This guide, is perfect for painters of all levels who want to know the secrets to achieving beautiful smooth paint on their miniatures without the use of an airbrush.\nIt will lead you through step-by-step the process and characteristics I use to thin my paints, in order to achieve flawlessly smooth paint results without an airbrush.\nWith detailed instructions, theory and technique tips to help you understand paint thinning and the benefits it offers.\nIt will take you through:\n🔸 looking at what the problem is,\n🔸 why thinning will help\n🔸 how much does the paint need to be thinned\n🔸 other consequences to paint thinning\n🔸 show you how to put it all together \n\n\n🔸 SUPPORT THIS CHANNEL 🔸\nIf you would like to help support this channel and get yourself a great discount too, then please use these links when buying GW and gaming products.\n🔸  UK & Europe - https://bit.ly/2Zmbd3u \n🔸  USA - https://bit.ly/40kCQYL \n\n\n🔸 ADDITIONAL VIDEOS:\nHow To Prepare Minis For Painting - https://youtu.be/KxF8t6k39cE\nHow To Edge Highlight - https://youtu.be/KoRbYuAfbEk\n\n\n🔸PAINT BUNDLE🔸\nUK & Europe - https://bit.ly/3JFW9oV\nUSA - Coming Soon\nSave yourself time and money with these 'one click' paint bundle, which includes all the paints you will need to paint to paint along with my painting tutorials\n\n\n🔸 BRUSHES\nThrough partnership with Artis Opus, I'm proud to say you can buy a custom Brushstroke brush set  containing all the brushes you will need to paint along with my painting guides\nUK & Europe - https://bit.ly/42NKGLH\nUSA & Rest of the World - https://bit.ly/42NKGLH\n\n\n🔸 PRIMER\nUK & Europe - https://bit.ly/3W4rnZY\nUSA - https://bit.ly/3HcE4fF\nSurface Primer - Black\n\n\n🔸 GAMES WORKSHOP CITADEL PAINTS\nUK & Europe - https://bit.ly/3jZceX5\nUSA - https://bit.ly/3ja84kp\nPhoenician Purple\nRetributor Armour\n\n\n\n\n\n🔸 VIDEO CONTENTS\n00:00​ - Intro\n01:00 - What exactly is the problem?\n02:02 - How will thinning the paint help?\n03:33​ - How much do you need to thin it?\n07:12​ - Other consequences to consider\n08:29 - Putting it all into practice\n19:12 - Further viewing\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFOLLOW ME\nTo see the latest minis I'm working on and for details on upcoming videos, competitions and more please follow me here:\n\n🔸 Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/brushstroke....​\n\n🔸 Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/brushstroke77/\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n#PaintThinning #ThinYourPaints #PaintingWarhammer #Warhammer #40K  #MiniaturePainting #warhammer40k  \n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDISCLAIMER: This video and description may contain affiliate links, which means that if you click on one of the product links, I'll receive a small commission. This helps support the channel and allows me to continue to make videos like this. Thank you for the support!","viewCount":128781,"lengthSeconds":1197,"watchProgress":579.88064,"timeWatched":1681385886052,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"LrAovgxIueMVuPDF"}
