{"videoId":"LVbUNRwpXzw","title":"Music for Productive Work — Tony Stark's Concentration Mix","author":"Chill Music Lab","authorId":"UCwVQIkAtyZzQSA-OY1rsGig","published":1650405600000,"description":"This deep and calm playlist is designed to help you focus and concentrate for the next hour. Relaxing downtempo and atmospheric future garage tracks are carefully mixed together to create an ideal background for your productive work. Whether it is work involving analytical thinking or one that requires creativity and inspiration, this playlist will be your faithful ally on the quest for productivity. With this electronic instrumentals you can achieve laser sharp focus and tackle any project.\r\nThis channel is dedicated to bringing you the most relaxing and peaceful music in the world. With a mix of ambient, new age, electronic, and space music, we strive to offer you the best selection of media for your relaxation and enjoyment.\nIf you enjoyed this video like, comment or subscribe to the channel. 🙏\n\nJoin our English-speaking Discord to get in contact with us and fellow music lovers. ❤️\nhttps://discord.gg/5p8D8GdVfp\n\nGenre: Downtempo\nStyle: Future Garage, Downtempo\nMood: Peaceful, Calm, Calming, Deep\nFeature: No prominent lyrics\n\n📹 Similar videos\nEnergy Music ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkcp_XPf2GiTOqUWAdvqM4ap\nFuture Garage ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkdbssGgnnIDm3EnE2gmHyEQ\nMusic Genres ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkffJbMAxlW17QgaBdhAfuY4\nAll Music VIdeos ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkemG2q7FaIGsQCcCHieasOE\nWork Music ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkc6L7Bgqzz_Q7q2JN2AqHV3\nChillout Music ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkeSTmryNClNxUkioFpq3Btx\nStudy Music ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkcx8_AcwRjTPiYSauQTQeNi\nHacker Music ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkfAWkk7-Clm18krBuziKQfr\nAmbient Music ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBketYRDDb8lheUOD4q7U27DR\nChillstep Music ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkeH0adsnxZupMARfGxY6qik\n\n🎧 Tracklist\n► 00:00 TBFM - Absence\n► 03:23 Randloev - Foggy Night\n► 05:55 Lowxy - Morphine\n► 09:40 Azaleh, Descant - Roadside\n► 11:41 4Lienetic - Feelings\n► 15:17 Lazarus Moment - Homebound\n► 18:26 Inhale - Midnight\n► 21:59 Grandyzer - Adore\n► 25:43 Inhale - Recall\n► 29:06 Kisnou, Vincent DiFrancesco - Muse\n► 33:49 Phelian - The Only Thing (Eikona Remix)\n► 39:04 Riversilvers - Nevermind\n► 42:46 Aurora Night - Stay\n► 45:39 Tim Schaufert - Homeward\n► 48:48 Rogg Collins - Off My Mind (Catch the Rise Remix)\n► 51:18 Drevmr - Rain\n► 53:33 Nuages - Machines\n► 57:11 4Lienetic - The Most Painful Goodbye\n\n\n #Downtempo #FutureGarage #MusicLab","viewCount":4257931,"lengthSeconds":3171,"watchProgress":3170.800906,"timeWatched":1683703442730,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"O2blB4SEacrszSL5"}
