{"videoId":"O6xtMrDEhcE","title":"Ryan Carniato - The World Beyond Components","author":"React Finland","authorId":"UCYRsLerK8J8uGWXFaprYa2A","published":1666303200000,"description":"Components have been the foundation of how we've built web applications for almost a decade now. They've defined not only how we organize our code but how it runs.\n\nIn this talk, Ryan, author of SolidJS, will look at what comes after the component model. Driven by the need for more granularity, and empowered by compilation, reactivity is becoming the universal language of user interfaces.\n\nDrawing: https://api.react-finland.fi/media/drawings/2022/ryan.jpg\nSlides: https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/11j-xrh8knB3eernOKhjMib1NZVLehHJ7yZRdfr_G9ec/edit?usp=sharing\n\n---\n\nReact Finland 2022 took place 12-16.09 at Paasitorni, Helsinki. We had 400 participants and lots of fun.\n\nGold Sponsors: Relex\nSilver Sponsors: Elisa, Nitor, Gofore, Supermetrics\nBronze Sponsors: Moon Highway, Solita, Huuva, Knowit, Utopia Music, Alma Media","viewCount":10622,"lengthSeconds":1840,"watchProgress":5.35193,"timeWatched":1682583936556,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"OltnLx2n2w5vcmJL"}
