{"videoId":"lEc_pywzgkk","title":"Lucid Dreaming - Guided Hypnosis with Binaural Beats","author":"Lights of Venus","authorId":"UCFj65Tri0E8mUhf8vYRPT6A","published":1588284000000,"description":"This guided hypnosis is designed to induce lucid dreaming. \n\nTo Lucid dream is to become conscious within a dream. Once conscious and aware, you can direct events in any way you like. You may for example want to act out some of your fantasies, seek answers to real life problems or gain other meaningful insight through thoughtful interactions. \n\nIf you would like to give this hypnosis a try, it is best to do so an estimated 30 mins before you would usually fall asleep. For best results, it is recommended not to consume any heavy, processed foods and liquids (including caffeinated beverages) at least 4 hours before going to bed. If possible, no food consumption is preferable. \n\nThis session uses the commonly known 'Reality Check' technique which helps you become aware of your current reality, whether it'd be in your waking state or inside your dream. Whilst in a dream, you are thus encouraged to become lucid. Our Reality Check will be presented to you in the form of several questions which you will be asked to answer based on your perception and awareness.\n\nThe Structure Of Our Hypnosis:\n\n- Introduction\n- Awareness Practice (Preparation for the Reality Checks)\n- Relaxation\n- Reality Check (Whilst Awake)\n- Deepening of the Relaxation (Falling Asleep)\n- 'Lucid Dreaming' Hypnotic Suggestions\n\n- Deep Sleep (1 hour)\n- REM Sleep / Dreaming (1 hour 13 mins)\n\n- 'Lucid Dreaming' Induction (Spoken Words Return)\n- Reality Check (Whilst Dreaming)\n- REM Sleep / Dreaming (10 mins)\n- Reality Check (Whilst Dreaming - 2nd attempt)\n- End of Session\n\nI hope you'll enjoy this session. Best of luck and sweet lucid dreams! :)\n\n~Lights of Venus~\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nhttps://www.facebook.com/lightsofvenus/\nhttps://twitter.com/Lights_of_Venus\nhttps://soundcloud.com/lightsofvenus\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nThis audio uses binaural beats and an isochronic pulse. (Alpha, Theta and Delta waves) For best results, please wear headphones. Both binaural beats and Isochronic tones are present using the following frequencies:\n\n211.44 Hz - ­Neptune Frequency / Intuition / Imagination / The Unconsciousness / Enhances the dream experience\n1052 Hz - Crown Chakra / Spirit / Liberation / Transcendence\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n© 2020. Lights of Venus Entertainment. All rights reserved.\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n#LightsOfVenus #Lucid Dreaming #Guided #Hypnosis","viewCount":3724535,"lengthSeconds":10983,"watchProgress":1867.002313,"timeWatched":1681982091460,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"PHG4nvu2LGLnQAnA"}
