y docker tutorials\ndocker simplified\ndocker detailed videos\ndocker tutorial in details\ndocker playlist\ndocker for college students\ndocker for school students\nbest tutorial on docker\nsimple tutorial on docker\ndocker for developers\ndocker for devops\ndocker for testers\ndocker for admins\ndocker for support engineer\n\n#dockerfile #dockerfile2 #docker #devops #howtocreatedockerfile #creatingdockerfileinwindows #creatingemptydockerfile #dockerbuildcotextdirectory","viewCount":1583,"lengthSeconds":193,"watchProgress":8.50727,"timeWatched":1686902469947,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"QpGeOVHd2KkAkGS4"}
