{"videoId":"Bfh4JvyCtV8","title":"Why Your Proportions are Wrong and How to Fix Them","author":"Proko","authorId":"UClM2LuQ1q5WEc23462tQzBg","published":1527717600000,"description":"When you start a drawing, do you jump right in to drawing all the small parts? Knock it off!\n\nSubscribe to Proko: http://bit.ly/SubProko\n\nIf you’re not an advanced artist with a well trained eye, starting with details usually ends with wacky proportions. In this student critique, we’ll examine the work of two students who focused on drawing foot bones without following the big-to-small hierarchy. I’ll show you a 2D technique called “enveloping” and then a 3D process that helps keep your forms dynamic and in proportion. Woo!\n\nPREMIUM - Want more? The premium section has more demonstrations, critiques, and extended lessons on the forms of the human body. It also has ebooks for each lesson that you can print out for review and has 3D models of bones and muscles that you can spin around, study, and draw from any angle. Get the course at http://proko.com/anatomy\n\nWatch More Proko: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D-h_JenFumY\n\nFull Access to Premium Videos - http://www.proko.com/anatomy\nDon't miss new tutorials - http://www.proko.com/subscribe\n\nCourse Package Deals - http://www.proko.com/package-deals\nPose photo sets - http://www.proko.com/poses\n\n-----\n\nFollow Proko:\nFacebook - https://www.facebook.com/prokotv\nTwitter - https://twitter.com/StanProkopenko\nPeriscope - @proko\nInstagram - http://instagram.com/stanprokopenko\nTumblr - http://stanprokopenko.tumblr.com/\nGoogle+ - http://bit.ly/stangplus\n\nEmail Newsletter- http://www.proko.com/subscribe\n\nWatch More Proko:\nLatest Uploads: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D-h_JenFumY\nFigure Drawing: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=74HR59yFZ7Y\nArt of Caricature: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FOURPIkpPXk\nPopular Videos: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1EPNYWeEf1U\n\n-----\n\nCREDITS:\n\nArtist | Instructor | Producer - Stan Prokopenko (http://www.stanprokopenko.com/)\nProduction Assistance - Sean Ramsey (http://www.peoplewhodrawstuff.com/), Brandon Storer, Cody Shank (http://codyshank.com/)\nEditing - Yana Popova, Brandon Storer, Sean Ramsey, Stan Prokopenko, \nStudents - Chanhee Lee, Lena Krupicka, Cj Roo Soto, Andreas Schiller, Frederic Hubert‎, Alejandro Farrera Hernandez, Pamela May Green, Shashanka Ghosh, Sou Green, Gery Adams, Bronwyn Knox, Mario Tokarzewski, Nick Kulynycz\n\nAbout Proko:\nInstructional How to Draw videos for artists. My drawing lessons are approachable enough for beginners and detailed enough for advanced artists. My philosophy is to teach timeless concepts in an entertaining way. I believe that when you are having fun, you learn better. I take pride in producing high quality videos that you will enjoy watching and re-watching.\n\n#anatomy #feet #artlesson","viewCount":306219,"lengthSeconds":1308,"watchProgress":362.847958,"timeWatched":1673116148236,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"R54XuDYi4qFKakTJ"}
