{"videoId":"TI_VR7BdZnU","title":"Sounds Familliar? Here's Help...","author":"Trovarion Miniatures","authorId":"UC2mGRYBQqZk6U_qtQxLDROg","published":1681250400000,"description":"Thanks a lot INTOTHEAM for sponsoring this video! Get your Elevated Everyday Graphic Tees now and grab a 10% discount site-wide by clicking on this link: https://intotheam.com/TROV \n\nPainters from my Discord Community were asking me for feedback on their painted miniatures. \"DON'T HOLD BACK\" they said. So here we are...\n\nIf you want to be in the next video, join the Patreon at: https://www.patreon.com/trovarion\n\n0:00 Memes and WTF is this video?\n1:35 Beginners/Color Choice\n5:50 Where to Place Highlights\n7:14 Gradients & Readability\n9:53 Working with Preshading\n11:50 Going beyond Drybrushing\n14:20 Introduction to Volumetrics\n18:38 Inner Glow\n20:36 Coherency\n22:54 Glowing Eyes\n25:01 Large Surfaces & Fire\n27:18 Scratches, Chips & Weathering\n33:52 Highlights on Vehicles\n37:30 The Basics of Bases\n42:16 Contrast through Shading\n45:46 Intermediate Volumetrics\n47:57 How Light Works on Busts\n49:26 Wear & Tear on Vehicles\n51:41 Light on Large Scale Minis\n54:36 Epic Skeleton Tocuhups\n56:18 Who will takeover this channel...\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPATREON: https://www.patreon.com/trovarion \nMY WEBSITE:  https://www.trovarion.com/\nDISCORD: https://discord.gg/aRaqY5t\nT-SHIRTS: https://teespring.com/de/stores/trovarion-fanshop-and-apparel\n\nFOLLOW ME AT:\nhttps://www.instagram.com/trovarion\nhttps://www.facebook.com/trovarion\nhttps://www.twitter.com/trovarion/\nhttps://www.twitch.tv/trovarion\n\nELEMENT GAMES affiliate link: http://elementgames.co.uk/warhammer?d=10383 \nELEMENT GAMES DOUBLE CRYSTALS REFERAL: CHR9186\n\nMY GEAR! (affiliate links that support me)\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nMy Wet Palette: https://www.redgrassgames.com/product/painter-2/?ref=65\n\nThe BRUSHES I use, Raphael 8404, Size 1 \nJackson's Art UK - BEST PRICE: https://bit.ly/2YVt0iS\nUS: https://amzn.to/38bei8F\nGermany: https://amzn.to/2TmfyS1\nUK: https://amzn.to/36U5tj7\n\nMASTER'S BRUSH CLEANER (keeps your brushes alive!)\nUS: https://amzn.to/36W1532\nGermany: https://amzn.to/2NplfLo\nUK: https://amzn.to/35RqV79\n\nMy EPIC basing material:\nhttps://epicbasing.com/discount/TREASURETROV10 \n\nMy 3D Printer (Elegoo Mars 3)\nhttps://www.elegoo.com/collections/mars-series/products/elegoo-mars-3-lcd-3d-printer\n\nI got my Magnifying Glasses from a local electronics store (CONRAD) and they are as basic as it gets. There are some options on amazon:\n\nUS:\nClosest to what I have:  https://amzn.to/2OLrvxH\nHeadband Version: https://amzn.to/38iNROH\nVisor Version: https://amzn.to/2UF9wwx\nVersion from the Future: https://amzn.to/31IlEhC\n\nUK:\nClosest to what I have: https://amzn.to/39iwQEq\nWith Headband: https://amzn.to/2UKECCS\nVisor Version: https://amzn.to/2SCaWVL\n\nGermany:\nExactly the ones I have: https://amzn.to/3bt3mp3\nSimilar ones: https://amzn.to/2SC0cqE\nWith Headband: https://amzn.to/39odZb0\n\nThe AIRBRUSH I use - H&S INFINITY\nUS: https://amzn.to/2uNjqRS\nGermany: https://amzn.to/3a2rDSd\nUK: https://amzn.to/372VAQt\n\nOTHER AIRBRUSHES I can recommend\nH&S EVOLUTION US: https://amzn.to/2NqhViR\nH&S EVOLUTION Germany: https://amzn.to/36SVaMm\nBADGER PATRIOT US: https://amzn.to/2Rdr93i\nBADGER PATRIOT Germany: https://amzn.to/2FPTaso\n\nAIRBRUSH COMPRESSOR (SPARMAX TC-610H):\nUK: https://amzn.to/386jbQk\nGermany: https://amzn.to/3a4ZU3j\n\nJames Gurney - Color and Light (MAD inspiration for miniatures)\nUS: https://amzn.to/2QPZnuE\nGermany: https://amzn.to/2Re2go4\nUK: https://amzn.to/2RoiR9X\nJackson's Art (UK): https://bit.ly/2TSd1PC\n\nJames Gurney - Imaginative Realism (even MADDER inspiration)\nUS: https://amzn.to/2QToCvS\nGermany: https://amzn.to/30ixfDu\n\n#warhammer\n#intotheam \n#miniaturepainting\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nThis channel is about painting miniatures for your warhammer, infinity, warmachine & d&d games, as well as age of sigmar and warhammer 40k. space marines, space wolves, sisters of battle, stormcast eternals, beastclaw raiders,  mawtribes, cities of sigmar, chaos space marines. Also painting different scale models and miniature busts! How to paint NMM. How to paint warhammer, how to paint D&D figures.","viewCount":35437,"lengthSeconds":3404,"watchProgress":2841.379249,"timeWatched":1681476992609,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"SOFgyLyevAADPmNb"}
