{"videoId":"ZUo-jEt8-5Y","title":"BEST 3D Printer Right Now - Uniformation GK TWO Review (great all-rounder Uniformation GKtwo)","author":"FauxHammer","authorId":"UC_9Jsf3SP8aMJgn0xv5jHjA","published":1681941600000,"description":"GIVEAWAY & DISCOUNT DETAILS BELOW - Click \"Show more\"\nBUY the Uniformation GKTWO Here\n(Gobal) (Discount Code “FAUXHAMMER): https://geni.us/Unfomation\n(UK)Yes, That;s 3D Printed : https://yesthats3dprinted.com/?ref=qr09mtou\nAMAZON: https://geni.us/GKTWO\n\nUniformation Facebook Group: https://www.facebook.com/groups/661715828314843\n\nWARNING!!!!!!!! - we have a scammer called “itsFauxHammer” on Telegram. We may get others.\n\nTHIS IS NOT ME!. The winner will be contacting fed by an account with my name only and I will speak to you on the phone or video before I ask for any personal details. You will also see you have been picked on our latest live video. Do not give details to scammers\n\nWINNER 1 - Lap87\nWINNER 2 - drawn @25,000 views\nWINNER 3 - drawn @50,000 views\n\n\nWell, the time has come - this is one that many people have been excited to watch! and yes, this is 20 minutes of me gushing over this printer? Why? The print quality is only on par with other printers I've reviewed of late... Well, watch the video to find out, because it's not about what it does, but how it does it!\n\nGIVEAWAY DETAILS\nUnformation wants a wider community reach, I want more YouTube Subscribers. You want a chance to win a free printer… So let’s work together to make that happen. \n\nThe Competition is open to everyone that Uniformation ships to – so to check eligibility, please see their page and ensure they ship to your locale https://www.uniformation3d.com/?sca_ref=3575400.VmDMwlcezK\n\nWe have up to 3 bundles to give away (1 bundle to each winner), each bundle will include;\n\n1 x  UniFormation GKTWO 3d Printer\n1 x Ultrasonic Resin Cleaner W230\n1 x D265 10.2″ Curing Station\n(FREE SHIPPING - watch out for scammers, we will not ask for any money from you)\n\nThat’s over €1300 USD (£1000 GBP) worth of stuff per winner! \n\nSo, here are the 5 simple steps to win. and it all revolves around increasing the visibility of this video, printer and brand as I noted above. Perform the following on \"THIS\" video.\n\n1. BE A SUBSCRIBER on my channel\n2. CLICK “LIKE” on the video\n3. WATCH THE FULL VIDEO – I don’t care if you leave it playing on your phone in another room with the sound off, but watch it end-to-end, because this helps Youtube recommend it to others.\n4. COMMENT ON THE VIDEO and tell me what you like to print/want to print on the GKTWO \n5. SHARE THE VIDEO – I don’t much care where, however, IT NEEDS TO BE A \"LINK\" TO THE VIDEO! tag me if you want. We will need to ask the drawn winner for proof this was done. You stick it in a Reddit post, on a forum post on Twitter, on your Facebook page, in a Facebook group! – But it needs to be \"public\" because we will be asking for a link to it as proof this step was done and remains live when the prize draws are done. If the drawn winner cannot show live evidence of the share, we will nullify the win and re-draw the prize.\n\nYes, it’s a bigger ask than most competitions, but it’s a much bigger prize pool than most too!. These manual steps very much help to ensure we avoid robots, scalpers and scammers from entering. \n\nWARNING - if anyone other than me replies to your comment saying you won! ignore it until we speak directly. DO NOT CLICK ON ANY LINKS sent by others, DO NOT PROVIDE PERSONAL DETAILS to people you don't know!!!\n\nHere’s when the Prize Draws will happen and how you can see them.\n\nOnce again, it will be on the YouTube Channel. The first draw will happen when this Video gets 10,000 views, the second draw will be at 25,000 views and the third at 50,000 views. And that’s views, not Subscribers – and yes, I am aware that people can just play the video on repeat to increase the views.\n\nWhen we hit those view milestones, I will do a live video with every name in the pool and announce the winner. I will then contact the winner, verify they are the correct person and that all the steps above were followed. I will pass their details onto Uniformation for them to ship you a printer with Wash and cure stations as a bundle.\n\nGiveaway End Date - July 31st 2023 (so we need 50k views by then! It's not too hard! Jessy gets that in a day!)\n\nThis Video is part of our series looking for the Best 3D printer for Miniatures; https://www.fauxhammer.com/top-10/the-best-3d-printer-for-miniatures-models/\n\nArtis Opus FauxHammer Essentials Set: https://store.artis-opus.com/products/fauxhammer-mixed-brush-set-5-brush-deluxe\n\nFauxHammer Patreon - https://www.patreon.com/fauxhammerblog\n\nFauxHammer Facebook Group - https://www.facebook.com/groups/PaintHub\n\nFauxHammer Discord - https://discord.gg/dPexM9SeN4\n\nBest Airbrush For Miniatures: https://www.fauxhammer.com/top-10/best-airbrushes-for-miniatures-wargames-models/\n\nBeginner Airbrush: https://www.fauxhammer.com/featured/best-beginner-airbrush-for-miniatures/","viewCount":20640,"lengthSeconds":1175,"watchProgress":1015.032886,"timeWatched":1682422560415,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"VhjRXGoggB9ZRBOZ"}
{"videoId":"rYrz1GW7pak","title":"Au Fait... C'est Quoi Le Medium ? [FR]","author":"Serial Painters","authorId":"UCzdPIZDlDbb9lW-FjlGI7Lw","published":1618524000000,"description":"Bienvenue à toi passionné de Hobby, aujourd'hui on va voir ensemble quels sont les avantages et les inconvénients de la dilution à l'eau et au médium. Et au passage on va en profiter pour répondre à ces questions : C'est quoi le médium ? A quoi ça sert ? Comment je l'utilise ? Y a t-il une différence entre le Lahmian Medium et le Contrast Medium de chez Citadel ?????????????\nUn programme bien chargé !\n\nComment nous soutenir ?\n Sur Tipeee: https://fr.tipeee.com/serial-painters/ \n\nSur Utip: https://utip.io/serialpainters/ \n\nEn laissant un like, un commentaire et en partageant, tu peux aussi t'inscrire avec le bouton Rejoindre (bonus coulisses, stickers...) ou faire un don avec le bouton Merci. Grâce à ton aide nous pourrons développer la chaîne et améliorer le contenu ! \nEnvie de connaitre les dernières actualités, les projets en cours, de nous poser une question ? Rejoignez nous sur facebook ! \n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/SerialPainters Et si vous êtes abonnés, rejoignez nous sur le groupe Facebook réservé aux abonnés: La taverne des Serial Painters https://www.facebook.com/groups/4561120874005331 \n#warhammer \n   #warhammer40k #warhammeraos #paintingwarhammer #RagingHeroes","viewCount":16321,"lengthSeconds":998,"watchProgress":1.744163,"timeWatched":1681375313897,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"ViX317fjq4r3ZMi7"}
