{"videoId":"KoRbYuAfbEk","title":"HOW TO EDGE HIGHLIGHT: A Step-By-Step Guide","author":"Brushstroke Painting Guides","authorId":"UCsnxQDYmE-HnaSD8TEohMNg","published":1602453600000,"description":"How to improve your edge highlighting.\nThis quick and simple guide will lead you through the key tips to help improve your edge highlight when painting miniatures. \nPerfect for painters of all levels with colour recipes and technique tips.\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n---------------------------------------------------🔸 SUPPORT THIS CHANNEL 🔸--------------------------------------------------------\n\n          If you would like to help support this channel and get yourself a great discount too\n                            then please use this link when buying GW and gaming products.\n                                                         🔸  https://bit.ly/2Zmbd3u 🔸\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPRODUCTS USED:\n\n🔸 BRUSHES\nThrough partnership with Artis Opus, I'm proud to say you can buy a custom Brushstroke brush set  containing all the brushes you will need to paint along with my painting guides\nUK & Europe - https://bit.ly/42NKGLH\nUSA & Rest of the World - https://bit.ly/42NKGLH\n\n\n🔸 SCALE75 PAINTS\nhttps://bit.ly/2S39sEk\nFlat Black\nEclipse Grey\nGraphite\n\n🔸 VIDEO CONTENTS\n00:00​ - Intro\n01:00 - What is edge highlighting?\n01:26​ - The 4 tips to getting better highlights\n03:40 - Putting it into practice\n05:22 - What if you make a mistake?\n06:27 - Highlighting soft edges\n07:06 - Recap\n07:38 - Like, Comment, Share\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFOLLOW ME\nTo see the latest minis I'm working on and for details on upcoming videos, competitions and more please follow me here:\n\n🔸 Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/brushstroke....​\n\n🔸 Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/brushstroke77/\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n#EdgeHighlighting #MiniaturePainting #PaintingWarhammer #Warhammer #40K #RavenGuard #SpaceMarines\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDISCLAIMER: This video and description may contain affiliate links, which means that if you click on one of the product links, I’ll receive a small commission. This helps support the channel and allows me to continue to make videos like this. Thank you for the support!","viewCount":68869,"lengthSeconds":505,"watchProgress":505.150112,"timeWatched":1681385373393,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"WENY6zPPYSFGkfiv"}
