{"videoId":"syCjXJam88I","title":"ASMR Whispered Sleep Hypnosis For Lucid Dreaming & Deep Healing | Delta Waves | 9 Hours","author":"Trigger Happy ASMR","authorId":"UCC3VMNxGyAR8EbZ3dAI9FiA","published":1681682400000,"description":"Short Version with music: https://youtu.be/Gw_QgTAKtGw\nShort version without music: https://youtu.be/dZzulNZI7TY\nLong version without music: https://youtu.be/p8_vtbOw6eQ\n\nIn this video, I will guide you through a journey of relaxation, self-discovery, and deep healing with this sleep hypnosis for lucid dreaming and deep healing. In this extended version, you'll be guided through a series of calming visualizations, body scans, and positive affirmations to help you release stress, connect with your inner self, and unlock the power of your dreams.\n\nWhether you're new to lucid dreaming or an absolute pro, this guided sleep hypnosis is designed to help you navigate your dream world, tap into your subconscious mind, and experience profound mental, emotional, and physical healing.","viewCount":7697,"lengthSeconds":33503,"watchProgress":1135.956881,"timeWatched":1681980951985,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"WY3OWkLG6DidDITJ"}
{"videoId":"yjY4uUyoF0w","title":"Ultimate Productivity Playlist — Chillout Music Mix","author":"Chill Music Lab","authorId":"UCwVQIkAtyZzQSA-OY1rsGig","published":1704894691000,"description":"🌙👩‍💻 Step into a world of focused productivity with our &quot;Code &amp; Concentrate&quot; playlist, designed for night owls who thrive in the quiet hours. Merging instrumental music with the art of coding, this playlist is your go-to for work, studying, or any task that demands deep concentration. Its chill yet motivational tunes are perfect as background music, aiding in programming or any intense cognitive activity. This blend of music enhances focus, accompanied by inspiring visuals of a girl working at her laptop, embodying the perfect balance of concentration and motivation.\r\n\r\nHit play, immerse yourself in your coding, work, or study project, and let our electronic music playlist fuel your productivity through the night. Whether it&apos;s developing software, preparing for exams, or crunching numbers, we&apos;re here to keep you focused, motivated, and in the zone! 🎧\r\n\r\n🖥️ Playlist Features:\r\nMusic for Focus: Carefully selected instrumental tracks to boost concentration and efficiency, ideal for a background setting while you work or study.\r\nCoding Companion: A perfect mix for programmers, students, and professionals working late, with a variety of genres ranging from ambient to soft electronic.\r\nStudy and Chill: Whether you&apos;re coding, writing, or crunching numbers, these tracks provide a chill atmosphere that keeps you motivated and concentrated.\r\n\r\n🌟 Enhance Your Work Experience:\r\nDistraction-Free Environment: Use this playlist to create a focused, motivational backdrop for your tasks.\r\nErgonomic Setup: Combine our music with a comfortable workspace arrangement for optimum productivity during long sessions.\r\nRegular Breaks: Boost your concentration and efficiency by pairing our music with short, frequent breaks.\r\n\r\n💡 Why Choose Our Playlist?\r\nTailored for Workers, Coders and Students: Every track is chosen with the needs of coding, studying, and intense concentration in mind.\r\nMotivating Visuals: The night coding scene adds a touch of relatability and inspiration, perfect for those who find their muse in the late hours.\r\nCurated Mix: We keep the playlist fresh with the best chill tracks to ensure your work or study sessions are always accompanied by the best motivational music.\r\n\r\n☝ Don&apos;t Forget About: \r\nProper Posture: Ensure your chair and desk are at the right height to keep your back straight and your arms at a comfortable angle.\r\nScreen Position: Position your screen at eye level to avoid neck strain, and about an arm&apos;s length away to reduce eye strain.\r\nLighting: Use adequate lighting to reduce glare and eye strain. Avoid working in a completely dark room.\r\nStaying Hydrated: Keep water nearby to stay hydrated, which is crucial for maintaining concentration and overall well-being.\n \nIf you enjoyed this video like, comment or subscribe to the channel. 🙏\nJoin our English-speaking Discord to get in contact with us and fellow music lovers. ❤️\nhttps://discord.gg/5p8D8GdVfp\n\nGenre: Chillout, Electronic Music\nStyle: Chillstep, Downtempo, Future Garage\nMood: Night, Dark, Atmospheric, Deep, Focus, Deep\n\n📹 Similar videos\n ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkf6X1lbOpL3tAWERvlYej2L\n ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkeSTmryNClNxUkioFpq3Btx\n ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkdbssGgnnIDm3EnE2gmHyEQ\n ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkeH0adsnxZupMARfGxY6qik\n ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkf0gwWO9-qeu-La5vSJPmPc\n ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkdsNAZNbzOUj61OQ5N0Ka26\n\n🎧 Tracklist\n► 00:00 Lazarus Moment - In A Cabin By The Lake\n► 02:08 Oscuro - The Weight Of The World\n► 05:12 Neskre - Wander\n► 07:46 Hollowz - Children (Cover)\n► 10:47 Andy Leech - Khula\n► 16:15 Vesky - Don&apos;t Leave Me\n► 19:14 Rtik - Lone Voices\n► 20:19 Oscuro - Now Or Never\n► 23:17 Vigotron - Lagoon\n► 26:10 Infinitum - Until Dawn\n► 29:50 Bythewvve - Moments\n► 32:42 Soundnet - Losing Hope Was Freedom\n► 38:27 Aether - Together By The Spirit Tree\n► 41:00 Alicks - Giants Under The Sea\n► 43:04 AK - Reaching for the Clouds\n► 46:45 Azaleh - Somnia\n► 50:52 4lienetic - If Only\n► 54:34 Victoriya - Bloom\n► 58:41 Many Miles - Keep Me\n► 1:01:49 BlauDisS - Ever After\n► 1:05:10 Jay Mellock  - Amazonia\n► 1:07:41 Subsets - All I Had\n► 1:09:19 Many Miles, Logic23 - Closer\n► 1:14:03 Alyas - Timeless\n► 1:17:30 Wiljan - Vik\n\n\n #<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/studymusic\">#StudyMusic</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/codingmusic\">#CodingMusic</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/nightfocus\">#NightFocus</a>","viewCount":17441,"lengthSeconds":4815,"watchProgress":2060.535569,"timeWatched":1705658926709,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"WZFwJafstdrm4LTe"}
