gress":1558.455835,"timeWatched":1682443168115,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"XMzn6i8xdUZNAHvB"}
{"videoId":"tx5kJvI14Jg","title":"Learning How to Draw","author":"Proko","authorId":"UClM2LuQ1q5WEc23462tQzBg","published":1671058800000,"description":"Get the full drawing basics course - https://proko.com/drawing\n\nDrawing is a visual language that can be learned just like any other language, and anyone can pick it up with the right guidance and practice. This lesson covers physical skills, like hand-eye coordination, and intellectual skills, like understanding perspective and shading that you’ll need in order to draw the images you imagine or observe. \n\nKeep in mind that these skills can be learned and improved, regardless of age or natural talent. Like any skill, becoming a good artist is mostly about spending a lot of time practicing and studying :) \n\nCHAPTERS:\n\n00:00 - Intro\n00:59 - Can I Learn to Draw?\n02:43 - Physical and Intellectual\n04:42 - The Mindset\n\n\nWhile you wait for the course to start, check out our\nOTHER FUNDAMENTALS LESSONS:\n\nThe Basic Elements – Shape, Value, Color, Edge - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TfAZt3O0sLY\nShading Light and Form – Basics - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V3WmrWUEIJo\nHow to Shade a Drawing - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-dqGkHWC5IU\nHow to Draw Gesture - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=74HR59yFZ7Y\nStructure Basics – Making Things Look 3D - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3uEtdDvK6Xo\nDrawing Measuring Techniques - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tZtnKp4fAPk\nThe Illusion of Depth – Contrast, Aerial Perspective and Form - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wlLU05hmXyA\nThe Illusion of Depth – Perspective, Details and Overlapping Forms - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LIuNehjFmUU\nThe Illusion of Depth – Edge, Line, Cast Shadow and Paint Thickness - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GJvH8CiExiM\nTop 5 Shading Mistakes - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LrHfrncvODQ\nTop 5 Drawing Mistakes - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tCZIqbRDphs\n\nDRAFTSMEN PODCAST:\n\nSeason 1 - https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLVeITADsnvo71FqaEdV7VgqDsi2D34Zet\nSeason 2 - https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLVeITADsnvo7TKLAkyrfhjJub1oN_Skn0\nSeason 3 - https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLVeITADsnvo7xOf8AHWc8doMXqBuMSetI\n\n#howtodraw #newartist #beginningtodraw\n\n\nSubscribe to Proko: http://bit.ly/SubProko\nDon't miss new tutorials - Hit the BELL!\n\nPremium Videos - http://www.proko.com/store\nPose photo sets - http://www.proko.com/tools\n\n\nFOLLOW PROKO:\n\nEmail Newsletter- http://www.proko.com/subscribe\nInstagram - http://instagram.com/stanprokopenko\nTwitter - https://twitter.com/StanProkopenko\nFacebook - https://www.facebook.com/prokotv\nTumblr - http://stanprokopenko.tumblr.com/\nPinterest - https://www.pinterest.com/stanprokopenko/pins/\n\n\nWATCH MORE PROKO:\n\nLatest Uploads: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-Pu1uGh1-Y4\nFigure Drawing: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=74HR59yFZ7Y\nArt of Caricature: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FOURPIkpPXk\nPopular Videos: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1EPNYWeEf1U\n\n\nABOUT PROKO:\n\nInstructional How to Draw videos for artists. My drawing lessons are approachable enough for beginners and detailed enough for advanced artists. My philosophy is to teach timeless concepts in an entertaining way. I believe that when you are having fun, you learn better. I take pride in producing high quality videos that you will enjoy watching and re-watching.\n\n\nCREDITS:\n\nArtist | Instructor - Stan Prokopenko (http://www.stanprokopenko.com/)\nProducer - Stan Prokopenko (http://www.stanprokopenko.com/)\nScript - Stan Prokopenko, Jesse Martel\nProduction Assistance - Stephen Clark (https://www.peppermintgentleman.com/), Ash Lo Russo (https://www.artstation.com/ash_lorusso ), Sean Ramsey\nEditing - Ash Lo Russo, Sean Ramsey, Stan Prokopenko\nCartoon Animations - Cody Shank (http://codyshank.com/)\nPublishing - John Birchall, Alex Otis \n\nAdditional music by the Youtube Audio Library","viewCount":87176,"lengthSeconds":436,"watchProgress":3.54205,"timeWatched":1673434866076,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"XQyEVz92PlI566za"}
