{"videoId":"b6_XsMcUojM","title":"🎄 Winter Lofi Holiday Mix 2022 ⛄ No Copyright Lofi Christmas Playlist 2022 🎅 Lofi Christmas Beats","author":"lofi geek","authorId":"UCyD59CI7beJDU493glZpxgA","published":1608678000000,"description":"🎄 Winter Lofi Holiday Mix 2022 ⛄ No Copyright Lofi Christmas Playlist 2022 🎅 Lofi Christmas Beats\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b6_XsMcUojM\n👇 More information below in the description 👇\n\nThis is a Lofi Christmas Collection with all traditional Christmas songs, but lofi remix. If you like my songs and remixes, you can like & subscribe. Thank you for motivating me to create more songs!\n\nAll songs by lofi geek:\nSpotify Playlist: https://spoti.fi/2IJzLy7\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/lofigeek\n\nArtwork & animation by Farian:\nhttps://twitter.com/farian\n\nMerry Christmas and a Happy New Year 2023! Warm blessings for you and your family. I hope this music will help you study, sleep, relax and release the stress. A Christmas Lofi Hip Hop Playlist that combines best Christmas songs.\n\nIt was a hard year for everyone, so I hope these lofi christmas beats will make your day happy. You can find all songs on my channel, as well you can visit my 24/7 lofi hip hop radio to make friends in the live chat.\n\n⭐ My songs can be used as background music for original and creative content, such as gaming, vlogs, tutorials, etc. on YouTube and Twitch. I want to support original creators to find safe music for their videos. Do not repost my songs nor use them in mixes/compilations.\nIn case you want to monetize the video using my songs, contact my label to release the claim. To monetize a video that has the songs used as background music, please send your video link to my label's email at communication@trendingmusicsystem.com - thank you!\n\nOn my channel you can find christmas lofi, christmas mixtape, lofi christmas, christmas music, christmas songs, christmas playlist, holiday music, christmas carols, happy new year, merry christmas, no copyright christmas music, lofi no copyright, christmas beats, chill study beats, christmas sleep music, christmas remix, lofi carols, jingle bells lofi, silent night lofi, and much more.\n\n#christmas #lofi #nocopyright","viewCount":842316,"lengthSeconds":12056,"watchProgress":12045.363452,"timeWatched":1673622988377,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"aVcmHOmWVlR7sk87"}
