{"videoId":"IcYRR3DEniU","title":"How to clean synthetic paintbrushes and fix hooked tips","author":"Midwinter Minis","authorId":"UC9XTzwex6rGLVUGS9cLKFLw","published":1598133600000,"description":"Here's a quick, easy, and cheap way to revive your affordable synthetic brushes.\n\nMusic by Midwinter Minis.\n\nSupport us on Patreon, get a shout-out, jump on the Midwinter Minis Discord, and take part in the Painty Points competition! https://www.patreon.com/midwinterminis\n\nListen to our album: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eWqw5iOh7Es\nBuy our album: https://midwinterminis.bandcamp.com/releases\n\nMidwinter Minis t-shirts and limited merch: https://snazz-dragon.com/collections/midwinter-minis\nSurprise your friend with a message from Guy! https://www.cameo.com/midwinterminis\n\nHere are some useful links for stuff we use. Amazon gives us a few pennies if you buy using these, at no extra cost to you! \n\nThe wall-mounted paint rack I use: https://geni.us/nailpolishrack\nThe voiceover microphone I use: https://geni.us/PodcastPro\nThe painting lamp I use: https://geni.us/DaylightLumi\nThe “hobby cam” I use for livestreams: https://geni.us/LogiBrioWebcam\nMy favourite headphones: https://geni.us/BeyerDT770Pro\nThe camera I used in 2020: https://geni.us/mwm50\nThe camera I use now: https://geni.us/SonyAlpha728-70\nHow I mount my camera to my desk: https://geni.us/SmallrigDeskClamp\nMy airbrush compressor: https://geni.us/AirbrushCompressor\nMy airbrush: https://geni.us/IwataAirbrush\nThe airbrush set I started with: https://geni.us/RevellAirbrush\nA great model paint starter set: https://geni.us/VallejoPaintSet\nA great beginner paint brush set: https://geni.us/RLTaklon\nCheap brushes for detail work: https://geni.us/RLDetailTaklon\n\n\n#brushcare #paintingtips #paintingwarhammer","viewCount":694476,"lengthSeconds":285,"watchProgress":107.912584,"timeWatched":1681381773700,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"eUJ3W5YI5ibsAPoG"}
