{"videoId":"oFSKuGfq5Us","title":"Quick Art Tips - 12 Days of Proko","author":"Proko","authorId":"UClM2LuQ1q5WEc23462tQzBg","published":1670540400000,"description":"Happy Holidays! You know, some say the best gifts come in small packages. So this year we’re releasing a bunch of art tips to help you out. Starting December 12th these shorts will start appearing here on YouTube Shorts, IG Reels, and TikTok. So follow one or all of them to not miss out on any valuable tips!\n\nAnd what kind of 12 Days of Proko would it be without some discount codes? Use code NAUGHTY or code  NICE, whichever you prefer to get 15% off courses and tools on https://proko.com/. Good through Dec 24th\n\nProko store - https://proko.com/store\n\n#arttips #holidaysavings #arthelp\n\n\nSubscribe to Proko: http://bit.ly/SubProko\nDon't miss new tutorials - Hit the BELL!\n\nPremium Videos - http://www.proko.com/store\nPose photo sets - http://www.proko.com/tools\n\n\nFOLLOW PROKO:\n\nEmail Newsletter- http://www.proko.com/subscribe\nInstagram - http://instagram.com/stanprokopenko\nTwitter - https://twitter.com/StanProkopenko\nFacebook - https://www.facebook.com/prokotv\nTumblr - http://stanprokopenko.tumblr.com/\nPinterest - https://www.pinterest.com/stanprokopenko/pins/\n\n\nWATCH MORE PROKO:\n\nLatest Uploads: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-Pu1uGh1-Y4\nFigure Drawing: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=74HR59yFZ7Y\nArt of Caricature: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FOURPIkpPXk\nPopular Videos: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1EPNYWeEf1U\n\n\nABOUT PROKO:\n\nInstructional How to Draw videos for artists. My drawing lessons are approachable enough for beginners and detailed enough for advanced artists. My philosophy is to teach timeless concepts in an entertaining way. I believe that when you are having fun, you learn better. I take pride in producing high quality videos that you will enjoy watching and re-watching.\n\n\nCREDITS:\n\nArtist | Instructor | Producer - Stan Prokopenko (http://www.stanprokopenko.com/)\nScript, Camera, Editor  - Stephen Clark (http://www.peppermintgentleman.com/)\n\nActors - Stan Prokopenko\n\nMusic Used with Permission","viewCount":11903,"lengthSeconds":69,"watchProgress":30.990912,"timeWatched":1671622567944,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"hMtvqREFxlhRYHeM"}
