{"videoId":"lNfVU9ipf5w","title":"Rome | Marius Update - Imperator: Rome 2.0 | 0 (Introduction and Setup)","author":"Mordred Viking","authorId":"UCJeY_3hoxxLAbZF9TLd7MXQ","published":1613516400000,"description":"The Marius Update for Imperator: Rome is here, bringing it up to version 2.0! This revamps military recruitment (Levies and Legions), brings in an entirely new UI and adds in a bunch of quality of life details (plus much, much more). Also, we have the new Heirs of Alexander update bringing lots of new content for the Successor States.\n\nWe're going back to basics and playing as Rome - so many things have changed, it only feels right we learn it all again.\n\nPlease like and subscribe to this channel if you enjoyed this game of Imperator: Rome! It really helps out! Likewise, if you have any tips, critiques or advice please do comment as I'd be pleased to read them. \n\nImperator: Rome and the Heirs of Alexander were given to me by Paradox at no charge.\n\nPatreon - https://www.patreon.com/MordredViking\nDonate - https://twitch.streamlabs.com/mordredviking\nTwitter - @MordredViking\nTwitch - https://www.twitch.tv/mordredviking\nDiscord - https://discord.gg/pFas4vz\nFacebook - https://www.facebook.com/MordredViking\nParadox Store - https://paradoxinteractive.pxf.io/MordredViking \nHumble Bundle Store - https://www.humblebundle.com/?partner=mordredviking\nPurchases using those links from Paradox Store or Humble Bundle give me a small kickback.\n\n#Imperator #Rome #MariusUpdate","viewCount":9364,"lengthSeconds":5495,"watchProgress":1333.715571,"timeWatched":1685543093710,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"hiPJ3SuLX78cuTfG"}
