{"videoId":"6-8ED4DW6A0","title":"Training Yourself to Draw From Imagination - Peter Han","author":"Proko","authorId":"UClM2LuQ1q5WEc23462tQzBg","published":1576710000000,"description":"Peter Han is an incredible artist, instructor and the author behind the well known art book “Dynamic Bible”. He joined us at the Proko booth during this year’s Lightbox Expo to record a few demos. In part 1 he talks about training to draw from imagination while drawing a dwarf and hog. He’ll take you through the thought process behind constructing a fantasy character while explaining line work and adding shadows with ink. \r\n\nIf you’ve been enjoying the 12 Days of Proko be sure to subscribe and hit that bell so you don’t miss any other videos.\r\n\nSubscribe to Proko: http://bit.ly/SubProko\r\nDon't miss new tutorials - Hit the BELL!\r\n\r\nPremium Videos - http://www.proko.com/store\r\nCourse Package Deals - http://www.proko.com/package-deals\r\nPose photo sets - http://www.proko.com/poses\r\n\r\n\r\nFOLLOW PROKO:\r\n\nPeter Han's Art - https://www.instagram.com/peterhanstyle/\r\nEmail Newsletter- http://www.proko.com/subscribe\r\nInstagram - http://instagram.com/stanprokopenko\r\nTwitter - https://twitter.com/StanProkopenko\r\nFacebook - https://www.facebook.com/prokotv\r\nTumblr - http://stanprokopenko.tumblr.com/\r\nPinterest - https://www.pinterest.com/stanprokopenko/pins/\r\n\r\n\r\nWATCH MORE PROKO:\r\n\r\nLatest Uploads: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-Pu1uGh1-Y4\r\nFigure Drawing: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=74HR59yFZ7Y\r\nArt of Caricature: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FOURPIkpPXk\r\nPopular Videos: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1EPNYWeEf1U\r\n\r\n\r\nABOUT PROKO:\r\n\r\nInstructional How to Draw videos for artists. My drawing lessons are approachable enough for beginners and detailed enough for advanced artists. My philosophy is to teach timeless concepts in an entertaining way. I believe that when you are having fun, you learn better. I take pride in producing high quality videos that you will enjoy watching and re-watching.\r\n\r\n\r\nCREDITS:\r\n\r\nArtist | Instructor | Producer\r\nPeter Han (https://www.artstation.com/peterhanstyle)\r\nProduction Assistance - Sean Ramsey (http://www.peoplewhodrawstuff.com/)\r\nEditing - Sean Ramsey, Charlie Nicholson, Stan Prokopenko\r\nIntro - The Freak Fandango Orchestra\r\nSound Effects - freesfx.co.uk, sonniss.com","viewCount":1703246,"lengthSeconds":1689,"watchProgress":1511.682442,"timeWatched":1671624568322,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"m2mftEvmkEWCc3j5"}
