{"videoId":"gqX0gLd7os0","title":"3-Digit Subtraction Without Regrouping | Elementary Math with Mr. J","author":"Elementary Math with Mr. J","authorId":"UCtAwJJ83P-xWuJpZf_mRpBw","published":1626904800000,"description":"Welcome to Subtracting 3-Digit Numbers Without Regrouping with Mr. J! Need help with triple-digit subtraction? You're in the right place!\n\nWhether you're just starting out, or need a quick refresher, this is the video for you if you're looking for help with 3-digit subtraction. In this video, Mr. J will go through 3-digit subtraction examples and explain how to subtract 3-digit numbers without regrouping.\n\nMore Subtraction Videos Without Regrouping:\n\n✅ Subtracting 2-Digit Numbers Without Regrouping:\nhttps://youtu.be/n0HDh8PP8sQ\n\n✅ Subtracting 2-Digit Numbers Using Expanded Form Without Regrouping:\nhttps://youtu.be/NFJFg97B-j0\n\n✅ Subtracting 2-Digit Numbers Using Base 10 Blocks Without Regrouping:\nhttps://youtu.be/dVQMXy6Pg7M\n\n✅ Subtracting 3-Digit Numbers Without Regrouping:\nhttps://youtu.be/gqX0gLd7os0\n\n✅ Subtracting 3-Digit Numbers Using Expanded Form Without Regrouping:\nhttps://youtu.be/I9Mq1EkXHLs\n\n✅ Subtracting 3-Digit Numbers Using Base 10 Blocks Without Regrouping:\nhttps://youtu.be/-pXRQpLgZJg\n\nAbout Elementary Math with Mr. J: This channel offers instructional videos that are directly aligned with elementary math standards (kindergarten math, 1st grade math, 2nd, grade math, 3rd grade math, and 4th grade math). Teachers, parents/guardians, and students from around the world use this channel to help with math content in many different ways. I hope you find this channel to be helpful as well! All material is absolutely free.\n\n📭 Email: mrj.elementarymath@gmail.com\n\n🎵 Music: https://www.bensound.com/royalty-free-music/track/small-guitar\n\nHopefully this video is what you're looking for when it comes to 3-digit subtraction.\n\nHave a great rest of your day and thanks for watching! ✌️✌️✌️","viewCount":32459,"lengthSecon