{"videoId":"ZE8vqYLjrBo","title":"10 ADVANCED TIPS & TRICKS - Combat Guide AGE OF WONDERS 4","author":"Ic0n Gaming","authorId":"UC15pq102hQe7FnGq68gKHoQ","published":1683583200000,"description":"My Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/icongaming\n\nHere is my PayPal-Account Donations are very welcome:\nhttps://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr?cmd=_s-xclick&hosted_button_id=RU42ZE37QDMLY&source=url\n\nOr Buy me a Coffee, if that's more your cup of tea: https://www.buymeacoffee.com/9T1PeXW\n\n00:00 - Intro\n00:29 - Use Pinning & Control Zones As Much As Possible\n02:38 - Temporary HP Fun\n04:06 - Playing Around Your Offensive Units\n05:42 - Roster Setup Offensive vs Defensive Units\n06:46 - Disable Are Massive\n08:04 - Elemental Variety Helps\n10:07 - Spells And How To Get The Most Out Of Them\n11:44 - Summons Are Cheesy And Powerful\n14:02 - Positioning Tips\n15:56 - Heroes Are Joker Units\n\nThis is a Tips & Tricks Compilation for Age Of Wonders 4. It features various Gameplay and mechanical advices, helping Beginners and Veterans. This Video Focuses on Advanced Battle & Combat.\n\nMy Twitch (streams happening regularly, follow me for notifications!): https://www.twitch.tv/justanic0n\n\nJoin my Discord, chat and miss no new episodes: https://discord.gg/vdFyGYX\n\nTwitter (All Streams get posted here when they air): https://twitter.com/GamingIc0n\n\nAnd last but not least, check out my Facebook!: https://www.facebook.com/JustAnIcon/","viewCount":3741,"lengthSeconds":1153,"watchProgress":0,"timeWatched":1683726159352,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"nVSsRWcTQJ2vjC8O"}
