{"videoId":"n3PeL94eT2c","title":"Timberborn: Brilliant Beaver Civ-Builder that KEEPS GETTING BETTER!","author":"JumboPixel","authorId":"UCiM2-cXu3Bbg5VrJlsK50PA","published":1705569056000,"description":"Timberborn Update 5 is here - Check it out on Steam now! https://lurk.ly/YTdQyY \nWelcome to Timberborn! The overwhelming positively received lumberpunk city builder and colony survival game that just received it&apos;s fifth major update - and they don&apos;t muck around when it comes to updates. In this SPONSORED video (with thanks to Mechanistry for reaching out and giving me an early look at Update 5) I&apos;ll introduce Timberborn and what makes it special, share some of my newbie tricks and insights on how to start a game, and cover Update 5 and the BADWATER it brings. Thanks for watching! <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/gaming\">#gaming</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/timberborn\">#timberborn</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/citybuilder\">#citybuilder</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/survival\">#survival</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/ad\">#ad</a> \n\nTIMECARDS\n0:00 - TIMBERBORN!\n0:32 - Early Lumberpunk Life &amp; Colony Building\n4:10 - DROUGHTS &amp; DANGERS\n7:33 - Timberborn Update 5 - BADWATER!\n11:35 - Bringing it all together","viewCount":3582,"lengthSeconds":825,"watchProgress":759.987298,"timeWatched":1714055765585,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"p9mm6LV9KDf6BBvv","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
