{"videoId":"X0xL3cadSz0","title":"Shading from Imagination","author":"Proko","authorId":"UClM2LuQ1q5WEc23462tQzBg","published":1622412000000,"description":"Steven Zapata is known for his amazing illustrations and skillful shading techniques. In this lesson he gives you an exercise for improving your ability to invent shaded forms! You’ll watch him assemble abstract flesh-like clusters to demonstrate how to make design decisions for rendering light and dark that you can apply to any form you can imagine. If you’re interested in taking Steven’s full course on the secrets of shading go to https://proko.com/stevensketches\n\nFOLLOW STEVEN: \nSteven’s Youtube: https://www.youtube.com/c/StevenZapataArt\nSteven’s Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/stevenzapata_art/\nSteven’s Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/stevenzapata\nProko: https://www.proko.com/profile/stevensketches/activity\n\nRelated Links:\nDrawing and Shading Complex Forms from Imagination - Steven Zapata - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=34skcL6l9aM\nProbing for Creativity with Ahmed Aldoori and Steven Zapata - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O60UpNWxu0w\n\n\n#shading #shapedesign #abstraction\n\n\nSubscribe to Proko: http://bit.ly/SubProko\nDon't miss new tutorials - Hit the BELL!\n\nPremium Videos - http://www.proko.com/store\nCourse Package Deals - https://www.proko.com/browse/courses\nPose photo sets - https://www.proko.com/browse/tools\n\n\nFOLLOW PROKO:\n\nEmail Newsletter- http://www.proko.com/subscribe\nInstagram - http://instagram.com/stanprokopenko\nTwitter - https://twitter.com/StanProkopenko\nFacebook - https://www.facebook.com/prokotv\nTumblr - http://stanprokopenko.tumblr.com/\nPinterest - https://www.pinterest.com/stanprokopenko/pins/\n\n\nWATCH MORE PROKO:\n\nLatest Uploads: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-Pu1uGh1-Y4\nFigure Drawing: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=74HR59yFZ7Y\nArt of Caricature: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FOURPIkpPXk\nPopular Videos: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1EPNYWeEf1U\n\n\nABOUT PROKO:\n\nInstructional How to Draw videos for artists. My drawing lessons are approachable enough for beginners and detailed enough for advanced artists. My philosophy is to teach timeless concepts in an entertaining way. I believe that when you are having fun, you learn better. I take pride in producing high quality videos that you will enjoy watching and re-watching.\n\n\nCREDITS:\nArtist | Instructor - Steven Zapata (https://www.artstation.com/steven-zapata)\nEditing - Steven Zapata\nAdditional Edits - Charlie Nicholson (https://www.instagram.com/shloogorgh/)\n\nMusic Used with Permission\nIntro - The Freak Fandango Orchestra\n﻿Music by Epidemic Sound (http://www.epidemicsound.com/)","viewCount":96477,"lengthSeconds":1376,"watchProgress":1375.225033,"timeWatched":1672219261136,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"pjSkN8iqqkIPZtCP"}
