{"videoId":"vsROasPXHhY","title":"Eavy Metal Black Armor explained in 5 minutes","author":"Zumikito Miniatures","authorId":"UChvLrvN9TyZ-rCuxPIhUHiA","published":1599775200000,"description":"If you want to paint Eavy Metal space marines with black armor, this short tutorial will show you how to do it in no time! Whether it is Black Templars or Raven Guard space marines all the mentioned tips will help you get your warhammer miniatures done.\n\nWould you shade the black armor? Build some volume? To paint proper Eavy Metal style black space marine armor, you have to most definitely edge highlight it! All the box arts of warhammer miniatures depend largely on this technique and that is why you want to use edge highlighting too. Once you put down few solid layers of edge highlights, you black armor will surely achieve the Eavy Metal style quality level!\n\nThese videos are essential watch if you want to improve:\nPainting Volumes: https://youtu.be/mw4NcKqaPJ0\nPainting Non Metallic Metal: https://youtu.be/wOGlHTRySlU \n\nThis space marines miniature that has been painted for the video is Bladeguard veteran from indomitus box set.\n\nSupport the channel by purchasing any hobby products using following links (As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases you do after using these links at no extra cost for you)\n\nAmazon US:\nAny product: https://amzn.to/37GMBGT\nI use Panasonic GH5 camera: https://amzn.to/3qNOTLP\nBasic Vallejo Colors: https://amzn.to/3pJd2BI\nLAMP: https://amzn.to/3s7wiuK \nVallejo Texture Paste: https://amzn.to/3CiHA4M\nWinsor and Newton series 7 brush: https://amzn.to/3yshutO\nStarting airbrush set: https://amzn.to/3s8NhwI\n\nAmazon UK:\nAny product: https://amzn.to/3wGfBK3\nI use Panasonic GH5 camera: https://amzn.to/30aZVCX\nBasic Vallejo paints: https://amzn.to/30fybNn\nLAMP: https://amzn.to/3og7T5J\nStarting airbrush set: https://amzn.to/2YzNDTD\n\nAmazon DE (and EU):\nAny product: https://amzn.to/392bXzs\nI use Panasonic GH5 camera: https://amzn.to/3w30DNJ\nBasic Vallejo paints: https://amzn.to/3cdUmH0\nLAMP: https://amzn.to/37hqAh1 \nStarting airbrush set: https://amzn.to/39h2CUT\n\nI use 3D printer from Anycubic: https://bit.ly/3akLGfP\n\nAll the music and soundeffects are from Epidemic Sound, support the channel by registering via this link: https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/npn6j7/\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/zumikit0/\nhttps://www.instagram.com/zumikit0/\n\nI am painting miniatures for warhammer, age of sigmar, marvel crisis protocol, D&D and much more! Whether it is superhero miniatures, heroic characters or space marines, I will paint them! If you are looking for some sweet miniature painting tutorials or warhammer hobby content in general, this is the right channel for you!\n\nI am painting miniatures for warhammer, age of sigmar, marvel crisis protocol and much more! Whether it is superhero miniatures or space marines, I will paint them! If you are looking for some sweet miniature painting tutorials or warhammer hobby content in general, this is the right channel for you!","viewCount":145149,"lengthSeconds":293,"watchProgress":166.498851,"timeWatched":1681372395118,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"v0M9IPRayVdUsUU9"}
