{"videoId":"kxbGIMVKacg","title":"Music for Work — Limitless Productivity Radio","author":"Chill Music Lab","authorId":"UCwVQIkAtyZzQSA-OY1rsGig","published":1668034800000,"description":"This radio is here to make your day more productive. It plays a carefully selected mix of deep future garage and soothing chillstep tracks that increase concentration, focus, and inspire you to be super productive. Non-intrusive electronic instrumentals will keep you active and motivated during your work sessions. Bring your productivity to the next level with this carefully arranged mix. Whether you are working from the office or studying at the library, our live stream will help enhance your productivity and move forward with style.\n \nIf you enjoyed this video like, comment or subscribe to the channel. 🙏\n\nJoin our English-speaking Discord to get in contact with us and fellow music lovers. ❤️\nhttps://discord.gg/5p8D8GdVfp\n\nGenre: Downtempo\nStyle: Chillstep, Future Garage\nMood: Inspiring, Motivating\nFeature: No prominent lyrics\n\n📹 Similar videos\nFuture Garage ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkdbssGgnnIDm3EnE2gmHyEQ\nChillstep Music ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkeH0adsnxZupMARfGxY6qik\nChillout Music ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkeSTmryNClNxUkioFpq3Btx\nWork Music ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkc6L7Bgqzz_Q7q2JN2AqHV3\nStudy Music ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkcx8_AcwRjTPiYSauQTQeNi\nHacker Music ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLdE7uo_7KBkfAWkk7-Clm18krBuziKQfr\n\n\n\n #FutureGarageRadio #DowntempoRadio #ChillstepRadio","viewCount":3267281,"lengthSeconds":3567,"watchProgress":0,"timeWatched":1687260270387,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"wzhmW9m7bw13rzmW"}
