{"videoId":"H8PsjnVqdrI","title":"The Art & Science of Drawing / Basic Skills","author":"Brent Eviston","authorId":"UC8viPXERsg6ldvpOmyaW6uQ","published":1499810400000,"description":"Enroll in this fundamental online drawing class for the lowest possible price: https://www.evolveyourart.com/faqs-inclusive\nThe first 500 people to use this link will get one month of Skillshare Premium for free and complete all of The Art & Science of Drawing on Skillshare: https://skl.sh/2RDsxgx\n\nThe Art & Science of Drawing is a remarkable program that will teach you how to draw one day at a time. The program is simple, each day you’ll watch one video lesson that will introduce an essential drawing skill, and then do the recommended practice. The Art & Science of Drawing is overflowing with powerful insights into the drawing process and offers some of the clearest, most accessible drawing instruction available.  Many of the tools and techniques you'll learn here are rarely seen outside of private art academies.\n\nWEEK ONE: BASIC SKILLS is designed for the absolute beginner, but is recommended for anyone wanting to improve their drawing skills.\n\nFollow Brent Eviston and the Art and Science of Drawing:\nNewsletter - https://mailchi.mp/ea1270cff6dd/3h62e8ot28\nSkillshare - https://www.skillshare.com/r/user/artandscienceofdrawing\nWebsite: https://www.evolveyourart.com/","viewCount":30235,"lengthSeconds":874,"watchProgress":752.071246,"timeWatched":1672947836520,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"zE8nQxwHU8Gp2XsD"}
{"videoId":"gvvy2zjTb0k","title":"You're Studying at an Oxford Library at Night 📜 | Dark Classical Academia","author":"StudyMD","authorId":"UC5CRP-6oxYenIgBj17CkBZg","published":1701882010000,"description":"Late night, alone, listening to dark classical academia at an Oxford Library...\n📜🖋️ 🎓\n\nStudyMD Music - Now Available On Spotify And Apple Music \n\nDark Classical Academia Volume 1: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rrfsfWrxfiA&t=0s\nDark Classical Academia Volume 2: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D9km3yXmR8k&t=0s\nDark Classical Academia Volume 3: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xH1dDAmmSgM&t=0s\n\nThe original music used in the videos is entirely created and produced by myself and the StudyMD team to which I have full exclusive rights and ownership.  Usage of the music in my videos without permission is prohibited. You can find our music on Spotify and Apple Music\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/darkaclassical\">#darkaclassical</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/classicalmusic\">#classicalmusic</a>  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/studymusic\">#studymusic</a>","viewCount":422910,"lengthSeconds":7218,"watchProgress":5433.965743,"timeWatched":1715174679371,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"zGYPG9Ym8D6fNl9E","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"zzE1vXIy7Xs","title":"[EN] Designing an eco-friendly web framework","author":"MTG France","authorId":"UCIuBHEwIFRjwRMm9--Ga1vg","published":1603753200000,"description":"Speaker : Henrique Doro\n\nThe JAMstack approach and static site generators can do a lot to reduce the amount of energy consume by ordinary websites by reducing the need for running servers. However, lengthy builds, unnecessary scripts, slow development experience, complicated set-ups and strict structures still keep 'em from achieving their whole potential when it comes to sustainability and inclusivity.\n\nWorking with static sites since 2017, I've accumulated a lot of insight into how things can be better for users, developers and the planet, and am in the process of designing the architecture of an eco-friendly, productive web framework for marketing websites and light web applications.\n\nIn this talk I'll share the principles behind it and anchor them on principles.green and other great resources out there to show web developers how can we be more eco-conscious and make a positive change in our daily work 😊","viewCount":146,"lengthSeconds":1169,"watchProgress":172.239463,"timeWatched":1673622789442,"isLive":false,"paid":false,"type":"video","_id":"zJnuTAnIufvOJVXz"}
